### 3.3 Teacher
#### 3.3.1 Create Teacher
# @name createTeacher
POST http://localhost:9091/api/teachers
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "name": "Jane Smith"
    }
}

###

#### 3.3.2 List All Teacher
GET http://localhost:9091/api/teachers
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.jwt}}

###

#### 3.3.3 List Teacher with ID
GET http://localhost:9091/api/teachers/{{createTeacher.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.jwt}}

###

#### 3.3.4 Update Teacher
PUT http://localhost:9091/api/teachers/{{createTeacher.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data": {
        "name": "Jane Updated"
    }
}

###

#### 3.3.5 Delete Teacher
DELETE http://localhost:9091/api/teachers/{{createTeacher.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.jwt}}

###